                    'Kitchen notes typed on an order line, such as "no onion — allergy", show under that dish on the ticket. A note changed after the dish was sent arrives as its own CHANGE card: the dish and what it says now, nothing new to cook. It sounds like a new ticket; tap Seen once you have read it and it leaves the board',
