                    'The booking page greys out what you cannot have: days you mark Closed or Walk-ins only (POS Setup → Reservations), specific closed dates such as Dashain, and any slot where guests from bookings you have ACCEPTED plus the party would exceed your seats — a request you have not answered yet does not fill a slot. The server refuses the same cases, so a stale page cannot slip one through',
