                    'A delivery platform (Foodmandu, Pathao: an amber badge) pays in lump sums the same way, oldest bills first, and each bill has a Commission kept box pre-filled from the rate in POS Setup → Delivery Partners. Only what the platform actually paid goes on the drawer, so the shift does not read short',
