                    'A payment entered by mistake: a Supervisor or Manager cancels its receipt with a reason. It stays on record marked Cancelled, its bills owe again, and Cash taken goes back out of the open drawer. A payment on a bill that has since had a Credit Note stands: the note dealt with that money',
