                    'Birthdays and anniversaries: a Supervisor or above records them with Edit on a customer\'s row, in the Nepali or English calendar, the year optional, and only after ticking that the customer agreed, as Nepal\'s Privacy Act requires. Withdrawing the agreement removes both dates. The POS Dashboard shows the next 7 days\' birthdays and anniversaries and Membership the next 7 or 30, each with a WhatsApp button that opens a wish to send from your own phone',
