                    'Points are earned automatically on any bill closed with a name and phone; the Orders floor and the Billing screen show what the last bill earned. They are spent at Charge, under Adjust this bill, which shows what can be spent and what this bill will earn (or why it earns nothing: not in a scheme, or below the minimum). Points can only be added or spent while a bill is being closed, by the person closing it — if adding them failed, the Owner or a POS Manager adds them in one tap from the customer\'s History in Customers → Loyalty',
