                    'Move (Owner and POS Managers, the ⋯ on a customer\'s row): when a regular changes their phone number, their points move to the new number in one step, with a reason kept on both numbers. Points held on an unpaid Credit bill stay until it is paid in full. The new number is added to the customer book if needed and joins the old number\'s scheme; the old number leaves its scheme',
